OL,3,GNEWSAResidents feel 'let down' by
OL,4,Acouncil as battery storage site
OL,5,Aapproved
OL,6,
OL,7,FResidents say they have been "let down"
OL,8,Fby their local council after a massive
OL,9,Fbattery energy storage site was
OL,10,Fapproved on appeal by Welsh government
OL,11,Fplanning inspectors.
OL,13,FDevelopers Innova have won a case to
OL,14,Fbuild a 400MW facility on a site near
OL,15,Fthe village of Rhostyllen, Wrexham,
OL,16,Fwhich it said could power 900,000
OL,17,Fhomes.
OL,19,FCampaigners claim Wrexham council
OL,20,Fofficers failed to represent them
OL,21,Fproperly at the inspectorate hearing.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
